	(text "LTC3122 boost, Burst Mode (PWM/SYNC low), true output disconnect: VBOOST is 0 V while the car is present. 9.6 V here, ~9 V at the tracker.\nBurst Mode output is ~190 mA at 2.5 V in, ~300 mA at 3 V; LTE bursts ride on C14/C15 and the tracker's own input capacitance.\nNo usable input UVLO (runs to 0.5 V): the cell lockout on sheet 4 is the only thing that stops it flattening the cell.\n1 MHz (R14). FB 909k/130k. Compensation is the datasheet 2xAA -> 12 V example: bench Bode / load-step required. Solder the pad: it is PGND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
